    "A Firm reminder's Urgent nudges with Break Through Focus on, and every Relentless nudge, ring as alarms." : {
      "comment" : "How Alarm Sounds Work, When It Plays: under \"Only alarms play it\". Firm and Relentless are strengths, Urgent a nudge's urgency."
    },
    "A Gentle reminder, or a Firm one with Break Through Focus off, never rings, so it has no Sound row." : {
      "comment" : "How Alarm Sounds Work, When It Plays: under \"Some reminders never ring\". Gentle and Firm are strengths; Sound is the form's row."
    },
    "A change applies from now on. What was already sent or held stays as it was." : {
      "comment" : "How Quiet Hours Work, Your Schedules: the note under the steps."
    },
    "A different Apple Account signed in, so sharing from the old one was removed." : {
      "comment" : "Share Activity: an entry for a change of Apple Account, which removed the old account's connections."
    },
    "A new schedule applies from the next time it's due. A new strength, pace or Break Through Focus setting applies from the next nudge." : {
      "comment" : "Top of the Edit Reminder form when the reminder isn't nudging: when changes apply."
    },
    "A nudge that falls in quiet hours is held, and counts as one you didn't answer." : {
      "comment" : "How Quiet Hours Work, Held Nudges: the line under the heading."
    },
    "A quiet hours schedule is a time, on the days you choose, when no nudge arrives." : {
