    "A reminder someone sends you rings with the sound chosen on your iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "How Alarm Sounds Work, Change Your Reminders: the note under the rows."
    },
    "A reminder that reaches its limit while held ends as Missed, with a note such as “%@”" : {
      "comment" : "How Quiet Hours Work, Held Nudges: under \"It can end as Missed\". Missed is a status. The placeholder is the Missed note, \"Quiet hours held 10 of its 20 nudges.\", in the language's quotation marks."
