    "Are you sure you want to discard these changes?" : {
      "comment" : "Asked when cancelling a sheet with changes: the reminder form, the tag sheet, or the Reminders or Tags filter."
    },
    "As if you'd swiped the nudge away, the next nudges come as planned, and the held ones count toward its limit." : {
      "comment" : "How Quiet Hours Work, Held Nudges: under \"Its reminder moves on\". Its limit is the reminder's give-up limit."
    },
    "Ask me first" : {
      "comment" : "Delivery Mode: a reminder from this person waits to be accepted before it nudges."
    },
    "At your Default Pace, %@, with Break Through Focus on." : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges: under a strength's line, before its schedule. The placeholder is the Default Pace, such as \"Consistent · 10 min\" or \"Escalating\"."
    },
    "Back" : {
      "comment" : "A tutorial sheet, such as How Sharing Works: the top bar's button (a back arrow) that goes back a page. Dimmed on the first page."
    },
    "Badges" : {
      "comment" : "Settings: row that shows whether the app icon may show a badge with how many reminders are nudging."
    },
    "Beacon" : {
      "comment" : "Alarm sound name: a beacon-like signal tone that ships with the app."
    },
    "Bell" : {
      "comment" : "Alarm sound name: a bell tone that ships with the app."
    },
    "Both days are included." : {
      "comment" : "Sent's filter sheet: under the first and last day a sent reminder may be due, by the next due time its row shows."
    },
    "Both days are included. A reminder with nothing more coming is found by its last due date." : {
      "comment" : "Reminders' filter sheet: under the first and last day a reminder may be due."
    },
    "Both nudges are notifications." : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges footer, when a reminder sends two nudges, as a long Consistent wait can, and neither rings as an alarm."
    },
    "Both nudges ring as alarms." : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges footer, when a reminder sends two nudges, as a long Consistent wait can, and both ring as alarms."
    },
    "Break Through Focus" : {
      "comment" : "Reminder details, Schedule: the per-reminder switch that sends nudges as alarms.\nThe reminder form's switch: whether its nudges get through a Focus."
    },
    "Break Through Focus is off, so during a Focus every nudge waits, unless you allow %@ in that Focus." : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges footer, for a reminder whose Break Through Focus switch is off. The placeholder is the app's name."
    },
    "Break Through Focus turned off" : {
      "comment" : "Change note line: the sender turned a reminder's Break Through Focus switch off."
    },
    "Break Through Focus turned on" : {
      "comment" : "Change note line: the sender turned a reminder's Break Through Focus switch on."
    },
    "Build" : {
      "comment" : "About page: row showing the app's build number, such as \"12\"."
    },
    "Can't Open Your Reminders" : {
      "comment" : "Title shown when the app can't read its stored reminders, for example before the first unlock after a restart."
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "comment" : "A sheet's cancel button (an xmark): the reminder form's, the tag sheet's, the Reminders and Tags filters', the invite hint's, and Disconnect's.\nCloses the alert without choosing a new time.\nCloses the discard question and goes back to the sheet with its changes.\nInvite: leaves the Already Invited question without sending.\nKeeps the quiet hours schedule instead of deleting it.\nKeeps the reminder instead of deleting it.\nKeeps the tag instead of deleting it.\nLeaves every reminder's sound as it is, instead of Use for All Reminders.\nSettings: keeps your data instead of deleting it."
    },
    "Cancel Invite" : {
      "comment" : "An invited person's page: opens the question that asks before canceling the invite.\nThe question before canceling an invite: cancels it."
    },
    "Cancel the invite to %@?" : {
      "comment" : "An invited person's page: the question asked before canceling the invite. The argument is the person's name, such as \"Jordan Lee\", or the address they were invited at."
    },
    "Canceled" : {
      "comment" : "My Day: under the title of a reminder someone sent that its sender deleted. It no longer nudges.\nReminder details: the heading of the note on a received reminder its sender deleted.\nStatus label: the person who sent a reminder deleted it, so it no longer nudges."
    },
    "Canceling stops the invite from working." : {
      "comment" : "An invited person's page: under Cancel Invite."
    },
    "Change One" : {
      "comment" : "How Quiet Hours Work, Your Schedules: the second numbered step, about editing a schedule."
    },
    "Change These" : {
      "comment" : "Accepting an invite: on the Connected sheet, opens the connection's page in Settings to change Status Sharing and Delivery Mode."
    },
    "Change Your Reminders" : {
