    },
    "Done" : {
      "comment" : "A tutorial sheet, such as How Sharing Works: the last page's confirm button (a checkmark), in place of Next, which closes the sheet.\nAccepting an invite: closes the Connected sheet.\nHow It Nudges, What to Expect: the picture's last pill, after an arrow from Nudge: the reminder marked Done.\nMy Day: a Nudging row's swipe action that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nMy Day: the button on a Nudging row that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nMy Day: the caption of the count of occurrences done today.\nNotification action: marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nNudge card's swipe action: marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nNudge card: the button that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nReminders tab: a Nudging row's swipe action and VoiceOver action that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nStatus label, and a Status row in the Reminders and Filter Sent sheets: an occurrence closed as Done.\nThe tag sheet's confirm button (a checkmark)."
    },
