    "OK" : {
      "comment" : "A connection's page: dismisses the message that a change couldn't be saved.\nA sent reminder's details or Sent row: dismisses the message that the reminder couldn't be deleted.\nAccepting an invite: dismisses the Couldn't Accept the Invite message.\nAccepting an invite: dismisses the Invite Unavailable message.\nAn invited person's page: dismisses the message that canceling failed.\nDisconnect's sheet and Connection Ended: dismisses Couldn't Disconnect.\nInvite: dismisses the Already Connected message.\nInvite: dismisses the Link Copied message and closes the sheet.\nInvite: dismisses the message that the invite couldn't be made.\nSettings and Turn Off Sharing's sheet: dismisses Couldn't Turn Off Sharing.\nSettings: dismisses the message that deleting failed.\nThe Apple Account Changed sheet: closes it.\nThe Edit Reminder form: closes the form of a sent reminder that was deleted while it was open.\nThe reminder form: dismisses the message that the reminder couldn't be sent."
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "A connection's page and the Connected sheet: Status Sharing is off.\nReminder details: Break Through Focus is off.\nSettings: status of the Alarms row when alarms are turned off.\nSettings: status of the Badges row when badges or notifications are turned off in iOS Settings.\nSettings: status of the Notifications row when notifications are turned off.\nSettings: the Quiet Hours row when no schedule is on, so quiet hours never hold a nudge."
    },
    "Oldest First" : {
      "comment" : "Reminders tab's Sort menu, sorted by Created: the reminder made first at the top."
    },
    "On" : {
      "comment" : "A connection's page and the Connected sheet: Status Sharing is on.\nHeader of the Custom repeat page's days: the weekdays, or the day of the month.\nReminder details: Break Through Focus is on.\nSettings: status of the Alarms row when alarms are allowed.\nSettings: status of the Badges row when the app icon may show a badge.\nSettings: status of the Notifications row when notifications and Time Sensitive are allowed.\nSettings: the Quiet Hours row while Quiet Now is on, so every nudge is held."
    },
    "On %@, from the start date. Change it to pick another day." : {
